cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use retractbench, please cite it as below."
title: "retractbench: measuring whether edits to a language model can be fully revoked"
abstract: >-
  An open benchmark that tests whether an edit to a language model can be
  undone, by comparing the model after the undo with the unedited model on
  the edited prompt, paraphrases, unrelated prompts and look-alike prompts,
  plus a two-sample test on sampled outputs.
type: software
authors:
